OL,3,GNEWSAThieves rip out cash machine
OL,4,Abefore explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves used a telehandler to smash
OL,7,Finto a shop and steal a cash machine,
OL,8,Fbefore setting the construction vehicle
OL,9,Fon fire and causing an explosion.
OL,11,FThe ATM was taken from the store on
OL,12,FHigh Street in Fenny Compton,
OL,13,FWarwickshire, at about 02:40 GMT.
OL,15,FThe suspects set the telehandler alight
OL,16,Fand made off with the stolen ATM,
OL,17,FWarwickshire Police said.
OL,19,FResident Hilary Birkbeck said the
OL,20,Fattack "caused a violent explosion and
OL,21,Ffire".
